    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;This August we will have a GIGANTIC COMMUNITY GARAGE SALE. Not a Market for Crafters…strictly a venue for garage sale enthusiasts. The plan is that we will rent spaces in our hall and parking lot to anyone interested in having a table of their own items for sale. We will offer options such as tented [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
